# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every
# platform. The index is already entirely LF (PowerShell scripts included), so
# this codifies what is there rather than changing it. CI fails when generated
# code differs from what is committed, and the Windows jobs would otherwise see
# CRLF checkouts as drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png    binary
*.ico    binary
*.ttf    binary
